---
title: "Duolingo"
description: "Duolingo lesson history — French and Turkish early on, an ongoing Greek streak since April 2026."
date: 2026-08-02
---

{% set habit = "duolingo" | getHabit %}

<p><a href="{{ '/habits/' | url }}">← All habits</a></p>

{% if habit %}
<p>{{ habit.description }} Source: {{ habit.source }}.</p>

<p><a href="https://www.duolingo.com/profile/SiJobling?via=share_profile_qr">Join me on Duolingo</a> or follow me with the QR code below.</p>

<p><a href="https://www.duolingo.com/profile/SiJobling?via=share_profile_qr"><img alt="QR code to follow Si Jobling on Duolingo" src="/assets/images/Duolingo_Sharing-782x1024.png"></a></p>

{% set lastLevel = lastKnownValue(habit.entries, 'level') %}
<div class="habit-stats">
  <div class="habit-stat">
    <span class="habit-stat__label">Sessions logged</span>
    <span class="habit-stat__value">{{ habit.sessionCount }}</span>
  </div>
  <div class="habit-stat">
    <span class="habit-stat__label">Current language</span>
    <span class="habit-stat__value">{{ habit.latest.language }}</span>
  </div>
  <div class="habit-stat">
    <span class="habit-stat__label">Total XP</span>
    <span class="habit-stat__value">{{ habit.stats.primaryTotal | formatMetric(habit.primaryMetric) }}</span>
  </div>
  <div class="habit-stat">
    <span class="habit-stat__label">Best session</span>
    <span class="habit-stat__value">{{ habit.stats.best | formatMetric(habit.primaryMetric) }}</span>
  </div>
  {% for stat in habit.stats.extra %}
    <div class="habit-stat">
      <span class="habit-stat__label">{{ stat.label }}</span>
      <span class="habit-stat__value">{{ stat.value | formatMetric(stat) }}</span>
    </div>
  {% endfor %}
  {% if lastLevel %}
    <div class="habit-stat">
      <span class="habit-stat__label">Last recorded level</span>
      <span class="habit-stat__value">{{ lastLevel.level }} <small>({{ lastLevel.language }}, {{ lastLevel.date | readableIsoDate }})</small></span>
    </div>
  {% endif %}
</div>

<p><em>The export only tags a language and level on some rows — French and Turkish are labelled throughout, but the Greek streak stops recording a level after {{ lastLevel.date | readableIsoDate }} even though it's been going ever since. Treat "last recorded level" as a floor, not the current level.</em></p>

{% set chart = habitTrendChart(habit) %}
{% if chart %}
  <figure class="habit-chart-figure">
    {{ chart | safe }}
    <figcaption>{{ habit.primaryMetric.label }} per session, across all {{ habit.sessionCount }} logged sessions. Marker colour shows whether a {{ habit.secondaryMetric.label | lower }} streak was recorded that session.</figcaption>
  </figure>
{% else %}
  <p><em>Log a few more sessions to see a trend chart here.</em></p>
{% endif %}

<h2>All sessions</h2>
<div class="habit-table-wrap">
  <table class="habit-table">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th scope="col">Date</th>
        <th scope="col">Time</th>
        <th scope="col">Language</th>
        <th scope="col">XP</th>
        <th scope="col">Accuracy</th>
        <th scope="col">Duration</th>
        <th scope="col">Combo</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for entry in habit.entries | reverse %}
        <tr>
          <td>{{ entry.date | readableIsoDate }}</td>
          <td>{{ entry.time }}</td>
          <td>{{ entry.language }}</td>
          <td>{{ entry.xp }}</td>
          <td>{% if entry.accuracy != null %}{{ entry.accuracy }}%{% else %}-{% endif %}</td>
          <td>{% if entry.durationSeconds != null %}{{ entry.durationSeconds | formatDuration }}{% else %}-{% endif %}</td>
          <td>{{ entry.combo or "-" }}</td>
        </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>
{% else %}
<p>No data yet.</p>
{% endif %}
